OL,7,
OL,8,FBut Defence Secretary Wes Streeting
OL,9,Fsaid she only had a "partial picture",
OL,10,Fwhile declining to speculate on
OL,11,Fpossible Iranian links
OL,13,FThe RAF base is used by the US
OL,14,Fmilitary. President Trump said the US
OL,15,Fhad the five men "under view for a long
OL,16,Ftime, and we got them"
OL,18,FOne person who lives near the base
OL,19,Ftells us that local people were sent
OL,20,Fhome by armed police just hours before
OL,21,Fthe suspects were arrested - others say
OL,22,Fsecurity had ramped up days before
